<title>ST VINCENT: CRICKET-WINDIES 147 AND 128-2 V SRI LANKA (222) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WINDIES 147 AND 128-2 V SRI LANKA (222) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies, 75 behind Sri Lanka on first innings, were 128-2 in their second innings when bad light forced an early close on the rain-hit third day of the second test on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: West Indies 147 and 128-2, Sri Lanka 222.</p>
